* SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
* IBM TSO register form: R1 buffer, R0 length, SVC 93.
* https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/zos/2.5.0?topic=tpg-register-form-tget-tput
         MACRO
&N       TPUT  &BUF,&LEN
         AIF   ('&BUF' NE '(9)' OR '&LEN' NE '(8)').BAD
&N       LR    1,9
         LR    0,8
         SVC   93
         MEXIT
.BAD     MNOTE 8,'unsupported TSO64 TPUT form'
         MEND
